[Header start]
! Bitmap Man — telling a secret. The eyes check the room WHILE the
! line is spoken, so this needs channels, not a program counter.
!
! ONE FILE, TWO SHAPES. [Main] is the sequential program; every
! [Track_*] section is a channel on the clock, where T[seconds] says
! WHEN rather than what-comes-next. Compiles to a Timeline.
[Header end]

